          [INFO] === dependency:3.10.0:tree (default-cli) @ spring-cloud-config-server ===
          [INFO] io.github.mihaly-farkas:spring-cloud-config-server:jar:0.1.0-SNAPSHOT
          [INFO] \- org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-config-server:jar:5.0.4:compile
          [INFO]    \- org.springframework.cloud:spring-cloud-config-client:jar:5.0.4:compile
          [INFO]       \- tools.jackson.core:jackson-databind:jar:3.1.4:compile


          Updating via `org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-dependencies` / `jackson-bom.version` property.
        -->
        <jackson-bom.version>3.2.2</jackson-bom.version>
        <!--
          ================================
           Vulnerability reported by Snyk
          ================================

          https://security.snyk.io/package/maven/com.fasterxml.jackson.core%3Ajackson-databind

          [INFO] === dependency:3.10.0:tree (default-cli) @ spring-cloud-config-server ===
          [INFO] io.github.mihaly-farkas:spring-cloud-config-server:jar:0.1.0-SNAPSHOT
          [INFO] \- org.springdoc:springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui:jar:3.1.0:compile
          [INFO]    \- org.springdoc:springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-api:jar:3.1.0:compile
          [INFO]       \- org.springdoc:springdoc-openapi-starter-common:jar:3.1.0:compile
          [INFO]          \- io.swagger.core.v3:swagger-core-jakarta:jar:2.2.52:compile
          [INFO]             \- com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind:jar:2.21.4:compile

